description: AO3 translation pipeline and Gemini provider rules
globs: "**/translation/**/*.{kt,kts}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# AO3 translation

- Always go through `TranslationProvider`
- Primary: Gemini (Flash-Lite default); CI: Fake only
- Translate: title, summary, chapter narrative
- Keep `canonicalKey` for fandom/pairing; optional `displayRu` only for UI
- Cache per chapter; resume must skip completed chapters
- Never set title/author to Unknown / Yandex.Translate as translation output
- Store API key in encrypted prefs; never log the key
- Chunk long chapters; backoff on 429
